# Keep secrets, local state and non-build material out of the deployment upload.
# Leading slashes matter: an unanchored `content` also excluded `lib/content`.
/.git
/.github
/.githooks
/.next
/node_modules
/data
/coverage
/dev
/docs
/tests
/resources
/research
/debug
/supabase
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
*.pdf

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
